flowchart LR
    Q[Arbitration queue] --> C[Contract detail<br/>HELD]
    C --> V[Verify record]
    V -->|MATCH| C2[Back to detail]
    V -->|MISMATCH| C2
    C2 --> R{Decision}
    R -->|Release to freelancer| RL[resolveDispute true → RELEASED]
    R -->|Refund client| RF[resolveDispute false → REFUNDED]
